// Differentials are near-locked, and they have to be at lunar gravity.
//
// With the Chrono default locking limit of 100 Nm these are effectively OPEN, and an
// open differential sends all torque to the wheel with the least grip. Every rover
// that got stuck showed exactly that: one wheel -- always the least-loaded one --
// spinning at 150-363 rad/s (rim speed up to 148 m/s) while the other three sat at
// 0.00 rad/s and the chassis did not move. More throttle only spun it faster, which
// is why throttle and steering both looked irrelevant while debugging.
//
// It bites here and not on Earth because lunar gravity makes every wheel load ~6x
// smaller. A wheel carrying 288 N on a 4-8 degree side slope breaks traction at
// 288 * 0.75 * 0.409 ~ 88 Nm, so the differential gives up long before the engine
// runs out of torque, and the rig is left with one spinning wheel and no drive.
//
// A secondary symptom: the transmission read the spinning wheel as road speed and
// upshifted to gear 6 while stationary.
//
// Real lunar rovers avoid this entirely by driving each wheel independently. The
// nearest equivalent for a shafts driveline is a locked differential.
//
// THESE LIMITS DO NOTHING ON THEIR OWN. ChShaftsDriveline4WD builds each lock as a
// ChShaftsClutch, sets this value as its torque CAPACITY via SetTorqueLimit, and
// then calls SetModulation(0) -- unlocked. A disengaged clutch transmits nothing
// however large its capacity, so raising these alone left the differentials fully
// open and one wheel still ran away at 31 rad/s beside an axle-mate at 0.02.
// RobotRig::InitializeOnTerrain must also call LockAxleDifferential(-1, true) and
// LockCentralDifferential(-1, true); this value then stops the now-engaged clutch
// slipping again at Chrono's 100 Nm default.
{
  "Name": "Polaris 4WD Driveline",
  "Type": "Driveline",
  "Template": "ShaftsDriveline4WD",

  "Axle Differential Locking Limit": 2000,
  "Central Differential Locking Limit": 2000,

  "Shaft Direction": {
    "Motor Block": [ 1, 0, 0 ],
    "Axle": [ 0, 1, 0 ]
  },

  "Shaft Inertia": {
    "Driveshaft": 0.5,
    "Front Driveshaft": 0.5,
    "Rear Driveshaft": 0.5,
    "Central Differential Box": 0.6,
    "Front Differential Box": 0.6,
    "Rear Differential Box": 0.6
  },

  "Gear Ratio": {
    "Front Conical Gear": 0.2,
    "Rear Conical Gear": 0.2,
    "Central Differential": -1.0,
    "Front Differential": -1.0,
    "Rear Differential": -1.0
  }
}
